    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102565" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταυρο-κᾰθάψια</span></b> , τά,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bull-fight</i>, held on
			occasion of a festival in Thessaly, Sch. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				2.78
			</span></i>; at Smyrna, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				3212
			</span></i>; at Sinope, ib.<i><span class="en">
				4157
			</span></i>: also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταυρο-κάθαψις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IGRom.</u>
				4.460
			</span></i> (Pergam.), unless <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταύρο-ψιν</span></b>  is for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ψιον</span>.</div>
